# Keep build contexts clean and reproducible. Excluding these ensures images
# are built from source only — never from host artifacts that could shadow a
# fresh build (e.g. a stale tsconfig.tsbuildinfo suppressing TypeScript emit).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
*.log
